App Review Extraction Engine (app.py)
This README provides an overview, code explanation, and usage guide for the app.py script, which powers structured information extraction from customer reviews using LangChain, Pydantic validation, and an external prompt template.

Architecture & Project Structure
To maintain clean code separation and simplify prompt iterations, the project is structured into distinct files:

app.py: The core application logic handling input validation, prompt rendering, and LLM orchestration.

prompt.md: The external Markdown file containing instructions and layout templates for the LLM.

eval.py: The evaluation script used to run test datasets and assess extraction quality.

